msgid "Read-only connection snapshot. When the backend records a flow_id, Timeline opens that exact retained causal trace; connections without a recorded flow remain unlinked."
msgstr "只读显示连接快照。当后端记录 flow_id 时，“时间线”会打开对应的保留因果追踪；没有已记录 flow 的连接不会生成链接。"

msgid "Read-only DNS cache and log resources. Loading another server cursor page freezes that dataset snapshot until you explicitly restart it."
msgstr "只读显示 DNS 缓存与日志资源。加载后续服务器游标页后会冻结该数据集快照，直到你明确重新启动实时快照。"

msgid "Read-only DNS request and response routing rules for one running generation. Request rules select upstream/asis/reject; response rules select accept/reject/requery. Source links use source_id → Native config source → exact local .dae path matching."
msgstr "只读显示当前运行代次的 DNS 请求与响应路由规则。请求规则可选择 upstream/asis/reject；响应规则可选择 accept/reject/requery。来源链接按 source_id → Native 配置来源 → 本地 .dae 精确路径进行匹配。"

msgid "Read-only node inventory and backend probe observations. The first server page stays live; loading another cursor page freezes that snapshot so sorting and filtering never mix generations."
msgstr "只读显示节点清单和后端探测结果。服务器第一页保持实时；加载后续游标页后会冻结当前快照，避免排序和筛选混入不同运行代次的数据。"

msgid "Read-only retained flow summaries. Timeline opens the recorded causal trace. Traffic and DNS rule links are generation-safe and never join historical evidence to a different current routing generation."
msgstr "只读显示已保留的流量摘要。“时间线”会打开记录的因果追踪；流量和 DNS 规则链接会校验运行代次，不会把历史证据错误关联到当前不同的路由代次。"

msgid "Read-only routing dictionary for one running generation. Rules are joined by generation_id + rule_id. Source navigation uses source_id from Native API config and only becomes clickable when that source path exactly matches a locally discovered .dae file."
msgstr "只读显示当前运行代次的路由规则字典。规则通过 generation_id + rule_id 关联；来源导航使用 Native API 配置中的 source_id，且只有来源路径与本地发现的 .dae 文件完全一致时才可点击。"

